10
00:54:42,352 --> 00:54:48,352
Source Code is a 2011 science fiction action thriller film
directed by Duncan Jones and written by Ben Ripley.

11
01:00:10,588 --> 01:00:16,588
It stars Jake Gyllenhaal as a US Army officer who is sent into an eight-minute virtual re-creation of a
real-life train explosion, and tasked with determining the identity of the terrorist who bombed it.

12
01:05:38,823 --> 01:05:44,823
Michelle Monaghan, Vera Farmiga, and Jeffrey Wright play supporting roles.

13
01:11:07,058 --> 01:11:13,058
It had its world premiere on March 11, 2011, at South by Southwest and was released by
Summit Entertainment on April 1, 2011, in North America and Europe.

14
01:16:35,294 --> 01:16:41,294
It received positive reviews from critics and was a box office
success, grossing $147.3 million on a $31.9 million budget.

15
01:22:03,529 --> 01:22:09,529
The film explores themes of race against time, bomb,
virtual reality, identity, investigation.

16
01:27:31,764 --> 01:27:37,764
The tone is intense and thought_provoking and mind_bending.
